course: dictionary
lesson: 1314
title: Caffeine
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Caffeine is a natural chemical found in coffee, tea, cola, energy drinks and chocolate. It makes people feel more awake and alert. «Coffee contains caffeine, which makes the brain feel more awake» tells you what it does: it wakes the brain up.
explain: Caffeine is a stimulant. That means it speeds some things up in the body, such as the heartbeat, and it can make it hard to sleep. «Energy drinks are not recommended for children because of the caffeine in them.» So for children, too much caffeine is not good.
explain: Context helps you here too. Read «The sugar and caffeine lift lasts a short while, and then many people feel tired, grumpy or low.» The clue is that the lift does not last, and the tired feeling comes after it, so lift must mean a short boost of energy.
fact: Caffeine is a natural chemical, so it is found in some plants.
fact: Coffee, tea, cola, energy drinks and chocolate can all contain caffeine.
fact: Caffeine makes people feel more awake and alert.
fact: Energy drinks have a lot of caffeine and are not for children.
fact: «Caffeine-free» means the drink has no caffeine in it.
exercise: What is caffeine? | *A natural chemical in coffee and tea that makes you feel more awake | A vitamin found only in fruit | A kind of sugar that makes you grow taller
exercise: «Energy drinks are not recommended for children because of the caffeine in them.» Why? | Because they taste bad | *Because they have a lot of caffeine in them | Because they are too expensive | Because they are too cold
exercise: A drink label says «caffeine-free». What does this mean? | It is the fizziest drink in the shop | *It has no caffeine in it | It is only for adults | It is made with extra caffeine
test: Which of these can contain caffeine? | *Tea and cola | Plain bread | Plain rice | Water and milk only
test: What does caffeine do to the heart? | It makes the heart stop | It makes the heart grow bigger overnight | *It makes the heart beat faster | It makes the heart turn blue
exam: «The sugar and caffeine lift lasts a short while, and then many people feel tired, grumpy or low.» What does lift mean here? | A ride in a car | *A short boost of energy | A heavy weight to carry | A long, deep sleep
